"太部神社","阿夫志奈神社","太部古天神社","栃井神社","高山陣屋下川辺出張陣屋跡","旗本大島氏陣屋跡（川辺陣屋）","下麻生城","岐阜県川辺漕艇場"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%9D%E8%BE%BA%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"川辺町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110707252","wikidata_qid":"Q1203748","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%9D%E8%BE%BA%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}